
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FAQ | TrustTenant</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">

    <style>
        body {
            display: block;
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #FFF8ED;
            color: #212529;
        }

        .faq-container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 55px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .faq-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #E9ECEF;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        .faq-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .faq-description {
            color: #777;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .accordion-item {
            border: 1px solid #E9ECEF;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px !important;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .accordion-button {
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .accordion-button:not(.collapsed) {
            background-color: #f38e1b;
            color: #212529;
            box-shadow: none;
        }

        .accordion-button:focus {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .accordion-body {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .faq-footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .faq-footer a {
            color: #C66A00;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .faq-container {
                margin: 25px auto;
                padding: 0 12px;
            }

            .faq-card {
                padding: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-card">

            <h1 class="faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

            <p class="faq-description">
                Find answers to common questions about TrustTenant.
            </p>

            <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button" type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faq1">
                            What is TrustTenant?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                        data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            TrustTenant is a rental history platform prototype
                            designed to help organize and manage rental-related
                            information and reports.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faq2">
                            Who can use TrustTenant?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                        data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            TrustTenant is designed around landlords, tenants,
                            and other rental-related roles. Some account types
                            and features may not yet be available in this demo.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faq3">
                            How do landlords submit reports?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                        data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Registered landlords can access the reporting
                            features from their dashboard and submit
                            rental-related information through the report form.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faq4">
                            Are submitted reports automatically approved?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                        data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            No. The platform includes an administrative
                            review workflow for submitted reports.
                            Report status depends on the review process.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faq5">
                            Can I update my account information?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="faq5" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                        data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Yes. Logged-in users can visit Account Settings
                            to update their personal information and change
                            their password.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#faq6">
                            Is TrustTenant a production service?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="faq6" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                        data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            No. TrustTenant is currently a demonstration
                            prototype. It is not intended for real-world
                            tenant screening or decisions about housing.
                            Please avoid submitting sensitive personal
                            information.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="faq-footer">
                <a href="/">Return to Home</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
